version 1
This is one of the thirty-seven tunes collected in 1943 in Derry, Pennsylvania
by musicologist Samuel Preston Bayard, as played by fiddler Sarah Gray Armstrong (1883-1957).
The tune was published in 1944 in "Hill Country Tunes, Instrumental Folk Music 
of Southwestern Pennsylvania", as tune #58. 
%%endtext